      "reading_order": 3,
      "text": "4. Since atoms were found to contain fundamen-\ntal particles, they must be divisible.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260317_fac1ab83-81e6-422f-84cf-3b23b86ae39a_1_block_003",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 232.0,
